    "Contrast geocentric and heliocentric explanations and articulate why heliocentric is preferred on parsimony grounds.",
    "Predict retrograde timing for an outer planet based on Earth's and the planet's relative positions.",
    "Compare retrograde loops of Mars, Jupiter, and Saturn and explain why more distant planets produce smaller loops."
